WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.914
We will start with modularity and standard views
Then we will inspect

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:11.760
reusable objects and their dependencies After that
we will explore

00:00:11.774 --> 00:00:17.660
controlled writes and access boundaries Materialized
views come next with

00:00:17.687 --> 00:00:23.440
a focus on freshness and refresh policy Finally we
will combine

00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:26.940
views and CTEs into a small reusable analytics layer
